    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"my_data_platform\"\nsubtitle: \"ATP/WTA Tennis Data Platform\"\nformat:\n    html:\n        number-sections: true\n        html-table-processing: none\njupyter: my_data_platform\necho: false\nexecute:\n  freeze: auto\n---\n\n## Executive Summary\n\nOpen-source ATP/WTA tennis data platform built on DuckLake, SQLmesh, and ibis.\nRaw CSV data from JeffSackmann's GitHub repository flows through bronze → silver → gold\nlayers. Gold tables expose player surface stats, head-to-head records, ranking history,\nand tournament statistics.\n\n- **Repository:** git@github.com:actuaristai/my_data_platform.git\n- **Author:** Actuarist AI\n- **Stack:** DuckLake · SQLmesh · ibis · pointblank · Quarto\n\n## Database Overview\n\n::: {#025aadbc .cell execution_count=1}\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=1}\n```{=html}\n<style type=\"text/css\">\n</style>\n<table id=\"T_d8fcd\">\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th id=\"T_d8fcd_level0_col0\" class=\"col_heading level0 col0\" >Schema</th>\n      <th id=\"T_d8fcd_level0_col1\" class=\"col_heading level0 col1\" >Table</th>\n      <th id=\"T_d8fcd_level0_col2\" class=\"col_heading level0 col2\" >Rows</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td id=\"T_d8fcd_row0_col0\" class=\"data row0 col0\" >bronze</td>\n      <td id=\"T_d8fcd_row0_col1\" class=\"data row0 col1\" >atp_matches</td>\n      <td id=\"T_d8fcd_row0_col2\" class=\"data row0 col2\" >30,616</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td id=\"T_d8fcd_row1_col0\" class=\"data row1 col0\" >bronze</td>\n      <td id=\"T_d8fcd_row1_col1\" class=\"data row1 col1\" >atp_players</td>\n      <td id=\"T_d8fcd_row1_col2\" class=\"data row1 col2\" >66,820</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td id=\"T_d8fcd_row2_col0\" class=\"data row2 col0\" >bronze</td>\n      <td id=\"T_d8fcd_row2_col1\" class=\"data row2 col1\" >atp_rankings</td>\n      <td id=\"T_d8fcd_row2_col2\" class=\"data row2 col2\" >1,432,079</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td